# Moving the last entry up in a Today pane that hides completed swaps it with the entry above there, while the done entry the pane hides keeps its place in the other Today pane.
file <<END
W:
	- Alpha @due({today})
	- Bravo @due({today}) @done({today})
	- Charlie @due({today})
END
keys gt <C-w> s gc G <A-k>
see │▌ - Charlie  W
keys g1 gg j x
keys G x
quit
saved <<END
W:
	- Alpha @due({today}) @done({today})
	- Bravo @due({today})
	- Charlie @due({today})
END
